# Copy is NOT needed on a provisioned VM: infra/scripts/bootstrap.sh writes castor.env there.
# For a laptop run:  cp castor.env.example castor.env  then fill in the two keys below.
# Nothing reads THIS file -- it is documentation plus a starting point.

# --- required: the model lane ---

# Your OpenRouter key. The gateway container holds it and spends it; the agent never sees it.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# What the claude CLI presents as its own credential. Running through the gateway (the default
# below) the gateway is keyless and ignores this, so paste the SAME sk-or- key here. Paste a real
# sk-ant- key instead if you also want web research: those turns bypass the gateway and go direct
# to Anthropic on this key.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Point the CLI at the gateway container. Castor's compose does not set this, so it must live
# here. Comment it out ONLY if you are running without --profile gateway and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
# holds a real Anthropic key.
ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://gateway:4000

# --- optional ---

# Direct Anthropic key for the image-interpret path. Falls back to ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, which must
# then be a real sk-ant- key or interpret returns its own error.
# VISION_API_KEY=

# Local development ONLY: disables edge auth entirely; a red banner says so on every page, and
# the boot log says so once. Only the literal word local turns it on.
# Never set this on anything reachable from a network.
# AUTH_MODE=local
